<h3><u>Akhri namaz</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Allah, allah allah..(6)<br />
Yu akhri hussain ne sajda adaa kiya..(2)<br />
jalti hui zamee&#39;n ko..(2)<br />
mo&#39;alla bana diya<br />
Yu akhri hussain ne sajda adaa kiya..(2)</p>

<p>1. Laashe jawa&#39;n thi saamne ibne batool ke<br />
seene se jo hata nahi akbar ke baad se<br />
wo haath kaanpta hua takbeer ko utha</p>

<p>2. Takbeer sunke laasha e akbar tadap gaya<br />
tharra rahe the zauf se maula ke dast o paa<br />
zakhmo se sheh ke aati thi al-hamd ki sadaa</p>

<p>3. Thi ghurbat e hussain par nabiyo ki bhi nazar<br />
tuti kamar thi gham mein alamdaar ke magar<br />
tha haalat e qayaam mein zahra ka laadla</p>

<p>4. Rote the is khayal se maula qayaam mein<br />
na mehramo ki bheed mein darbar e shaam mein<br />
zainab khadi rahegi bhala kaise berida</p>

<p>5. Yaad aagaya ruku mein beemar ka safar<br />
zainab ki beridayi ke ghum mein jhukaye sar<br />
darbaar tak ruku mein sajjad jayega</p>

<p>6. Masjid mein reh gaya tha jo ek sajda e ali<br />
maqtal mein ibne zahra ne wo sajda aakhri<br />
fuzto be rabbe kaabe ki tareekh mein kiya</p>

<p>7. Aayi jo aasmaan se awaaz e irji&#39;ee<br />
zainab ke sar se chadar e tatheer gir gayi<br />
sajde me sar tha shaah ka khanjar gale pe tha</p>
</p>
